            <ArticleTitle>Sudden coronary deaths associated with sexual activity.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>216-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Two cases of sudden coronary deaths occurring in circumstances of unusual sexual activity are reported. Previous recorded cases are reviewed and the subject is discussed as regards the magnitude of the problem, its circumstances, the mechanisms involved, and the preventive measures to be adopted.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
